design
# PNGs are excluded wholesale (screenshots would bloat the context), but the
# shipped raster set must be negated EXPLICITLY — this list must move with any
# icon rename, or the file silently vanishes from production (icon.png →
# icon1.png did exactly that: the manifest icons and the JSON-LD logo 404'd
# live until the Ledger Letter mission tripped over it, 2026-08-14).
**/*.png
!app/icon1.png
!app/apple-icon.png
!public/icon-192.png
!public/icon-512.png
!public/brand/letter-stamp.png
!public/social/**/*.png
npm-debug.log*
.env*
.DS_Store
README.md
PLAN.md
scripts/*-shots.mjs
